{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33208","headline":"愤惋诗三首 二 · 刘损","name":"愤惋诗三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾辞旧伴知何止，凤得新梧想称心。\n红粉尚存香幕幕，白云将散信沈沈。\n已休磨琢投泥玉，嬾更经营买笑金。\n愿作山头似人石，丈夫衣上泪痕深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘损","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}